  "strings": [
    "Upon every level, Minas Tirith is burning.\u0000",
    "The gates lie shattered and the lower circles of the city are overrun.\u0000",
    "From the Hallows where dead Kings of Gondor watch in horror...\u0000",
    "to the White Tree that burns, all is now in ruin.\u0000",
    "Orcs now hold banquet in the White Tower of Ecthelion\u0000",
    "and desecrate both king and commoner alike.\u0000",
    "Thus passes Minas Tirith, the White City.\u0000",
    "and with it the best hope for the world of Men.\u0000",
    "The war must go on, but we have been grievously harmed.\u0000"
  ]
